{"id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","title":"Euclidean Topological Data","display":"df-euclidean-topological-data — Euclidean Topological Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-euclidean-topological-data","aliases":["58-df-euclidean-topological-data"],"display":"df-euclidean-topological-data — Euclidean Topological Data","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-euclidean-topological-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-euclidean-topological-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-euclidean-topological-data — Euclidean Topological Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md\">../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbb R^n\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\tau,\\sigma,B\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\tau,\\sigma,B\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\subseteq X\">\\(B\\subseteq X\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R^n=\\{f\\mid\\mathrm{Function}(f,n,\\mathbb R)\\}\">\\(\\mathbb R^n=\\{f\\mid\\mathrm{Function}(f,n,\\mathbb R)\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum_{i\\in\\varnothing}r_i=0\">\\(\\sum_{i\\in\\varnothing}r_i=0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedUnitDisk}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedUnitDisk}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OpenUnitDisk}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OpenUnitDisk}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelativeTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RelativeTopology}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S\\)</span> 是下述定义的函数，在所声明的参数域内取值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euclidean\\text{-}distance}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(n,x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\sqrt{\\sum_{i\\in n}(x(i)-y(i))^2}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euclidean\\text{-}distance}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(n,x,y)\\coloneqq\n\\sqrt{\\sum_{i\\in n}(x(i)-y(i))^2}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euclidean\\text{-}subspace\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(A,n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{U\\subseteq A:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall y\\in A\\;(\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(n,x,y)&lt;r\\to y\\in U)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}euclidean\\text{-}subspace\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S(A,n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{U\\subseteq A:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\n\\forall y\\in A\\;(\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S(n,x,y)&lt;r\\to y\\in U)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}unit\\text{-}disk}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClosedUnitDisk}_S(n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\sum_{i\\in n}x(i)^2\\leq1\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}unit\\text{-}disk}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ClosedUnitDisk}_S(n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\sum_{i\\in n}x(i)^2\\leq1\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}unit\\text{-}disk}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OpenUnitDisk}_S(n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\sum_{i\\in n}x(i)^2&lt;1\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}open\\text{-}unit\\text{-}disk}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OpenUnitDisk}_S(n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^n:\\sum_{i\\in n}x(i)^2&lt;1\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}disk\\text{-}boundary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(n)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{ClosedUnitDisk}_S(n)\\setminus\\mathrm{OpenUnitDisk}_S(n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}disk\\text{-}boundary}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S(n)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{ClosedUnitDisk}_S(n)\\setminus\\mathrm{OpenUnitDisk}_S(n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelativeTopology}_S(X,\\tau,B)\\coloneqq\\{B\\cap U:U\\in\\tau\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}relative\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RelativeTopology}_S(X,\\tau,B)\\coloneqq\\{B\\cap U:U\\in\\tau\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}product\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(X,\\tau,Y,\\sigma)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{W\\subseteq X\\times Y:\\forall\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in W\\;\n\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists V\\in\\sigma\\;\n(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\times V\\subseteq W)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}binary\\text{-}product\\text{-}topology}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(X,\\tau,Y,\\sigma)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{W\\subseteq X\\times Y:\\forall\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in W\\;\n\\exists U\\in\\tau\\;\\exists V\\in\\sigma\\;\n(x\\in U\\land y\\in V\\land U\\times V\\subseteq W)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\to\n\\mathrm{FinitePowerTopology}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{W\\subseteq X^n:\\forall x\\in W\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau^n\\;\n\\left((\\forall i\\in n\\;x(i)\\in U(i))\\land\n\\{y\\in X^n:\\forall i\\in n\\;y(i)\\in U(i)\\}\\subseteq W\\right)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nn\\in\\omega\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\to\n\\mathrm{FinitePowerTopology}_S(X,\\tau,n)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{W\\subseteq X^n:\\forall x\\in W\\;\\exists U\\in\\tau^n\\;\n\\left((\\forall i\\in n\\;x(i)\\in U(i))\\land\n\\{y\\in X^n:\\forall i\\in n\\;y(i)\\in U(i)\\}\\subseteq W\\right)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>圆盘在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0\">\\(n=0\\)</span> 时为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>，其边界为空集；这两个结论由断言推出，而非依赖负维球面的文字约定。</li>\n<li>二元积使用有序对编码，不把有序对载体与以有限序数为定义域的函数积混为一谈。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-topological-space.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb R^n","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y,\\tau,\\sigma,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"B\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R^n=\\{f\\mid\\mathrm{Function}(f,n,\\mathbb R)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum_{i\\in\\varnothing}r_i=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EuclideanDistance}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EuclideanSubspaceTopology}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedUnitDisk}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OpenUnitDisk}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DiskBoundary}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\